        "created_at": "2022-11-29T15:16:20.369Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Let’s learn about the Mocktriarch</p><aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-232-writers-room-a-murder-most-fowl\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-232-writers-room-a-murder-most-fowl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/9a9dbe46c644d40585f2b2c15b4093a02ea2bdf1.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-232-writers-room-a-murder-most-fowl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Letters Page: Episode #232 - Writers' Room: A Murder Most Fowl</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Birds birds birds! But are they real birds?  Show Notes: Run Time: 1:15:55 We tell a story that we've known for a while, but have never shared here! We also take a variety of questions on a variety of topics! You know, like we usually do on this...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n<p>\nCover is the same one we see for the Matriarch CE.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/7/7958dfc48df949a9b5585e002607f46c6e312452.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/7958dfc48df949a9b5585e002607f46c6e312452\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7958dfc48df949a9b5585e002607f46c6e312452_2_353x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"hjubwb1zW7CzGu4ZI7vGelcMHqW\" width=\"353\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7958dfc48df949a9b5585e002607f46c6e312452_2_353x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7958dfc48df949a9b5585e002607f46c6e312452_2_529x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7958dfc48df949a9b5585e002607f46c6e312452_2_706x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7958dfc48df949a9b5585e002607f46c6e312452_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×2716 413 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>",
