        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2022-11-29T18:17:04.035Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hey, at least the kid’s hooked on fruit. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>\n<p>I am so glad Christopher also heard “Emmanuel Transmission” and brought it to light.</p>\n<p>Gee, if that static is something they talked about in an episode, why bleep it out? <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/open_mouth.png?v=12\" title=\":open_mouth:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":open_mouth:\"></p>\n<p>A lycanthropic goose? Love it.</p>\n<p>There are two wolves inside you, and Apex can see them both.</p>\n<p>I’m really into vampire Miss Marple now, though. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/open_mouth.png?v=12\" title=\":open_mouth:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":open_mouth:\"> What could Poirot be?</p>\n<p>So what I’m hearing is it’s time to start shipping Muerto and Muse. (And in the back, there’s someone who’s like, “What do you mean ‘start’?”)</p>\n<p>I am way into that ghost fight idea, that is great. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>",
