        "cooked": "<p>Okay, this is definitely the oldest episode I haven’t heard before.</p>\n<p>I wonder if there’s a half completed flesh child if Alpha in Biomancer’s lair.  Maybe even Rambler?</p>\n<p>Ray Manta is a believer in “birds aren’t real”, and points to grainy 30 year old video of Mocktriarch fleshbirds as proof that all birds are fake.</p>\n<p>Silence, Biomancer!  I am here to scruit your plans!</p>",
